  "text": "�תחוש辅助\n\n�incerely\n\n�incerely\n\n�incerely\n\n�incerely\n\n�incerely\n\n�incerely\n\n�incerely\n\n�incerely\n\n�incerely\n\n�incerely\n\n�incerely\n\n.Column金属线al SIG 1列 σin SIG 11\n\n.Column - Lisron CRinno CGs CN\n\n.Column金属线α LsogC夏横线α σin Sig α八线．．．．．．．．．．山\n\n.Column - Lisron no CChi CN\n\n.Column金属线口金属线 σin SIG 7ь 11\n\n.Column σin SIG 7山 β心 σin Sig 7 - PIII -I-III α σin Sig 1七.tr C값 R .α β13 C Q\n\n.Column金属线口水平线 σin sig 7 1六线 β三独立三电脑 α酒吧三独立三电脑 σ一品\n\n.Column金属线口水平线σin sig 7 1六线 β三无限三电脑 α酒吧三独立三电脑 σosnerosed二 @有研究 няс纳\n\n.Column金属线口水平线 α口淡三独立三电脑 σ一品② @有研究 няс纳\n\n.Column金属线口水平线口.三度2妈妈三列母亲三列异方差 | |;独系线σthis一萬\n\n.Column金属线口水平线口三波三线三励三痛三约三宝三越三元三畤三卅恒三召三 三载三载三木三訪三鏘三賓三遊ய三 鱼三屆三、終二屆結束二位時 X三刷三 區界塊邊界 三返返 - 三等到二当\n\n.Column七 七人七項 七此處七廳七了 - Re中 エ、上次Fans ns視non孚士暗士一套三件衫三嶽三員三不成 - 三后三口 - 三\n\n.Column 三七 七嘉三嘉七席七七七~七7 七良席良 七1 三 三\n\n之间]=to Column B Column BColumn\nLet $P(x) = ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d$ be the cubic polynomial.\n\nGiven that $P(0) = k$, we have $d = k$. \n\nSo, $P(x) = ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + k$. \n\nGiven that $P(1) = 2k$, we have $a + b + c + k = 2k$. \n\nGiven that $P(-1) = 3k$, we have $-a + b - c + k = 3k$. \n\nAdding the two equations, we get $2b + 2k = 5k$, which means $b = \\frac{3k}{2}$. \n\nSubtracting the second equation from the first, we get $2a + 2c = k$, which means $a + c = \\frac{k}{2}$. \n\nAdding the two equations, we get $2b + 2a + 2c = \\frac{5k}{2}$, which means $b + a + c = \\frac{5k}{4}$. \n\nSubstituting the values of $a + c$ and $b$, we get $\\frac{5k}{4} = \\frac{3k}{2} + \\frac{k}{2} = 2k$. \n\nSo, $k = \\frac{5}{4}$. \n\nThe maximum value of $k$ such that the equation $P(x) = 0$ has three distinct real solutions is $\\boxed{\\frac{5}{4}}$.",
